{"arc":[{"id":"arc","headword":"अर्च्","headword_slp1":"arc","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"1. √अर्च्, अ꣫र्चति und *ऋचति\n— 1〉 strahlen, glänzen.\n— 2〉 singen, lobsingen, besingen.\n— 3〉 Jmd (Dat.) Etwas (Acc.) anpreisen.\n— 4〉 Jmd ehren, seine Achtung erweisen; Etwas achten. Ausnahmsweise auch Med. अर्चित geehrt, dem Verehrung erwiesen worden ist, in hohem Ansehen stehend; mit Achtung gereicht.\n— 5〉 schmücken. अर्चित geschmückt "},{"t":"cite","s":"R. 1,2,29","q":"R"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— Caus. अर्चयति\n— 1〉 strahlen machen.\n— 2〉 Jmd ehren, seine Achtung erweisen. Auch Med.\n— Mit अनु Jmd (Acc.). zujauchzen.\n— Mit अभि Act. Med.\n— 1〉 singen, besingen, preisen.\n— 2〉 ehren, verehren, seine Achtung erweisen. अभ्यर्चित wird mit अभ्यर्थित verwechselt.\n— Mit समभि ehren, verehren, begrüssen.\n— Mit प्र\n— 1〉 vorleuchten.\n— 2〉 anheben zu singen.\n— 3〉 besingen.\n— 4〉 Jmd (Dat.) Etwas (Acc.) anpreisen.\n— 5〉 ehren.\n— *Caus. ehren.\n— Mit अभिप्र besingen.\n— Mit प्रति\n— 1〉 entgegen strahlen.\n— 2〉 einen Gruss erwiedern.\n— Caus. einzeln begrüssen.\n— Mit सम्\n— 1〉 feststellen.\n— 2〉 ehren, verehren.\n— 3〉 schmücken.\n— Caus. ehren."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"2. अ꣫र्च् Adj. strahlend."}]}]}],"arcaka":[{"id":"arcaka","headword":"अर्चक","headword_slp1":"arcaka","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्चक Adj. verehrend, m. Verehrer."}]}]}],"arcatri":[{"id":"arcatri","headword":"अर्चत्रि","headword_slp1":"arcatri","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्च꣫त्रि Adj. singend, donnernd."}]}]}],"arcatrya":[{"id":"arcatrya","headword":"अर्चत्र्य","headword_slp1":"arcatrya","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"(अर्च꣫त्र्य) अर्च꣫त्रिअ Adj. zu preisen."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"(अर्चत्र्य) अर्चत्रि꣫अ, so zu lesen."}]},{"n":3,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"अर्चत्र्य॑ (अर्चत्रि꣫अ) "},{"t":"cite","s":"I. 5","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"arcatria":[{"id":"arcatria","headword":"अर्चत्रिअ","headword_slp1":"arcatria","senses_r":[{"n":1,"